  "description": "Professional = the highest level in the sport. X = 10 years. Professional-X = ten years of progression.\n\nDK celebrates 10 years of high performance with the all new Professional-X series of race bikes. Building on the same proven geometry that’s been raced to countless UCI World titles and Olympic main events, the Professional-X frame is remastered to be stiffer, stronger, and deliver more speed straight out of the gate. The pro-level build delivers straight out of the box too. BOX Components X5 carbon fiber fork and lightweight Echelon 1-piece seat/post combo come standard. Other impressive spec includes top of the line components from DK, ProMax, Maxxis, and DUO Brand.\n\nCranks Forged alloy 2-piece, 180mm\n\nBB 24mm European external (outboard)\n\nSprocket 44-tooth, alloy, 4-bolt chainring\n\nChain Taya TB980 3/32”\n\nPedals DUO Brand Resilite platform\n\nRims DUO Brand R2, double wall, 36-hole, front and rear specific design\n\nFront Hub DUO Brand R2, fully sealed, 20mm thru-axle\n\nRear Hub DUO Brand R2, fully sealed, 15mm thru-axle, 16-tooth cassette with 120 engagement points\n\nTires 20x1.75” (rear), 20x1.95” (front) Maxxis Torch\n\nSeat BOX Echelon 1-piece seat/post combo\n\nSeat Post Integrated, 27.2mm, alloy\n\nSeat Post Clamp Promax quick-release\n\nBMX RACE BIKE SIZE GUIDE",
